<!--
  Morning Mood
  Morgenstemning, from the music to Peer Gynt (1875). Edvard Grieg. Public domain.
  C major (the original is in E major), 6/8, dotted quarter = 50 (quarter = 75), 13 bars (31 s).
  The opening theme three times: as the flute and then the oboe play it, and as the
  orchestra brings it back at sunrise; the last C is held. Right hand: the theme, C4-A4.
  Left hand: a C3-G3 drone, like the held strings. Every note is in C3-B4.

  bar | right hand        | left hand | words
    1 | G4 E4 D4 C4 D4 E4 | C3 G3     | flute
    2 | G4 E4 D4 C4 D4 E4 | C3 G3     |
    3 | G4 E4 G4 A4 E4 A4 | C3 G3     |
    4 | G4 E4 D4 C4       | C3        |
    5 | G4 E4 D4 C4 D4 E4 | C3 G3     | oboe
    6 | G4 E4 D4 C4 D4 E4 | C3 G3     |
    7 | G4 E4 G4 A4 E4 A4 | C3 G3     |
    8 | G4 E4 D4 C4       | C3        |
    9 | G4 E4 D4 C4 D4 E4 | C3 G3     | orchestra
   10 | G4 E4 D4 C4 D4 E4 | C3 G3     |
   11 | G4 E4 G4 A4 E4 A4 | C3 G3     |
   12 | G4 E4 D4 C4       | C3        |
   13 | (C4)              | (C3)      |
-->
